# Bottomless Pool's target is a creature, yours or an opponent's: on turn 3 Bot1 casts the Pool (Mox Sapphire) with Bot2's Ornithopter in play, and
# the Mox Sapphire (an artifact, not a creature) and the Pool itself (an enchantment) are refused as targets, then Bot2's Ornithopter is taken and goes
# back to Bot2's hand (CR 400.3, its owner's), not Bot1's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Bottomless Pool // Locker Room
Island x5
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x6
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bottomless Pool // Locker Room.Cast(Ability: Bottomless Pool)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Pool)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot2.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = 
Bot1.Battlefield = Bottomless Pool; Mox Sapphire
